---
title: Leading Teams That Bring Agentic AI into Production
layout: layouts/home.njk
heroCanvas: true
eleventyNavigation:
  key: Home
  order: 1
numberOfLatestPostsToShow: 3
---
<section class="hero">
  <canvas class="hero__canvas" id="hero-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  {% include "hero-posts.njk" %}
  <div class="hero__tooltip" id="hero-tooltip" hidden></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero__content">
      <span class="hero__eyebrow">Agentic AI · Delivery Leadership · Governance</span>
      <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        25 years in software, the last years leading delivery teams of up to 35 people. My teams
        build agentic software for large enterprises. I care about what happens after the demo:
        delivery that is deterministic, auditable, and ready for real users.
      </p>
      <p class="hero__project">
        Open source: <a href="https://aspark.lottes.dev/en/">aSPARK</a> – a methodology and toolchain that
        brings determinism and auditability to software delivery in mixed teams of people and agents. MIT.
      </p>
      <p class="cluster hero__actions">
        <a class="button" href="/{{ lang }}/blog/">Read the blog</a>
        <a class="button button--ghost" href="/{{ lang }}/about/">About me</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="container section">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="section-head__label">Topics</span>
    <h2>What You Will Find Here</h2>
    <p class="section-head__desc">
      The focus is actionable knowledge over hype: concise guides, deep dives, honest retrospectives,
      and templates you can apply directly in real projects.
    </p>
  </div>
  <ul class="grid">
    <li class="card">
      <span class="card__num">01</span>
      <h3 class="card__title"><a href="/{{ lang }}/blog/">Agents in Production</a></h3>
      <p class="card__desc">Real-world notes on planning, prompting, tool usage, and quality controls in agentic workflows.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <span class="card__num">02</span>
      <h3 class="card__title"><a href="/{{ lang }}/blog/">Leading AI Delivery</a></h3>
      <p class="card__desc">Team setup, roles, and what it takes to get from pilot to production at enterprise clients.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <span class="card__num">03</span>
      <h3 class="card__title"><a href="/{{ lang }}/blog/">Governance and Auditability</a></h3>
      <p class="card__desc">Determinism, traceability, and clear roles for teams where people and agents ship together.</p>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="container section">
  {% set postsCount = collections.posts | filterCollectionLang | length %}
  {% set latestPostsCount = postsCount | min(numberOfLatestPostsToShow) %}
  {% set morePosts = postsCount - numberOfLatestPostsToShow %}
  <div class="section-head section-head--row">
    <div>
      <span class="section-head__label section-head__label--alt">From the blog</span>
      <h2>Latest Posts</h2>
    </div>
    {% if morePosts > 0 %}
      <a class="section-head__link" href="/{{ lang }}/blog/">All {{ postsCount }} posts →</a>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  {% set postslist = collections.posts | filterCollectionLang | head(-1 * numberOfLatestPostsToShow) | reverse %}
  {% set postslistCounter = postsCount %}
  {% include "postslist.njk" %}
</div>
